  "description": "The YITAMOTOR skid steer pallet fork frame, made from heavy-duty grade 50 steel with a 4,000 lb capacity, features double protection with powder coating and paint for rust and scratch resistance. The adjustable fork blades can be moved between 17\"-37\", and the frame is compatible with most loaders and tractors, making it perfect for farm, factory, warehouse, and construction tasks.\nFitment\nSuitable for most loaders and tractors; Compatible with Bobcat Skid Steer, New Holland, and Kubota tractors; Ideal for handling most farm, factory, warehouse, and construction site work\nFeatures\nQUALITY STEEL: The YITAMOTOR skid steer pallet fork frame is made from heavy-duty grade 50 steel that can withstand up to 4,000 pounds of pulling force, enabling you to effortlessly carry heavy objects\nDOUBLE PROTECTION: The joint use of powder coating and painted finish makes us stand out from other single-finish applied alternatives; This double application grants a robust & smooth surface that has excellent rust & scratch resistance\nADJUSTABLE PALLET FORK BLADES: The pallet fork frame is a quick-connect skid steer that can be directly installed on the machine. The pallet fork blade can be freely moved on the skid steer frame, and the distance can be adjusted within a 17\"-37\" range on the frame; The extended top bracket reduces timber slipping risk during handling\nEXTENSIVE COMPATIBILITY: Suitable for most loaders and tractors; Compatible for Bobcat Skid Steer, New Holland, and Kubota tractors; Ideal for handling most farm, factory, warehouse, and construction site work",
